# Cloudflare Pages custom headers for bareboard.org
# NOTE: Do NOT add a global Content-Security-Policy here — individual pages
# already carry per-page CSP <meta> tags (some allow upload.wikimedia.org for
# device photos). A global CSP would break those pages.

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
